      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE CRIMSON PIRATE (7) found them a bit sharp in his latest trial, though his late work was solid when under riding. He was a strong winner fresh and worked through the grades nicely, with the sting out of the ground no issue for him. Can return with a bang. ANGEL UNDERCOVER (1) just missed here last start when the race favourite in a stronger event, beaten 0.8L. Riordan's claim comes in handy as she carries top weight here, though she does come in with some strong form under her belt. Has won 2/4 third-up and looks ready to strike again. YES I KNOW (8) was very impressive over 1200m last start when rounding them up after being slowly away. He is right up in grade now, but his Victorian form - particularly at this trip - makes for good reading. Can make his presence felt. CHARINO (2) is better than he showed last start and can improve. WONDERFULLY MADE (6) hit the line alongside THE CRIMSON PIRATE in her heat. Fiore rides her over THE CRIMSON PIRATE too. Can return on a winning note.",
